Helios DXVK fork: NVK backend and foreign (NVK-made) resource import

Conduit guest/windows/docs/dxvk-on-nvk.md, stage S3. Applied to third_party/dxvk
by ci/windows/Build-Driver.ps1 (the fork is not ours to push to).

- HELIOS_DXVK_BACKEND=nvk (set by the UMD for an NVK device): shared images
  are not exported as OPAQUE_FD/DMA_BUF but allocated dedicated with the
  Helios export request (sType 1000384003), from which NVK mints a KMD
  resource id; importing a shared resource on NVK fails cleanly.
- HELIOS_DXVK_FOREIGN_IMPORT=1 (UMD knob ForeignImport): a Venus device
  enables VK_EXT_image_drm_format_modifier, and a texture opened with the
  KMD's foreign layout trailer (D3D11_HELIOS_IMPORT_INFO::Foreign) is imported
  as an explicit DRM-modifier image with that modifier, pitch and offset,
  bypassing the GDI staging and alias paths.

